'''Impenetrable Bastion''' is a skill used by Bastion class [[Mercenaries]]. The skill description reads ''Creates an impenetrable barrier around an allied target, briefly making them completely invulnerable to damage.''

==Version history==
{{Version history table header}}
{{Version history table row|3.26.0e|
* '''Impenetrable Bastion''''s cooldown no longer ticks while the immunity Buff is active on a player or the Mercenary.
}}
{{Version history table row|3.26.0d|
* (In Hotfix 4) '''Impenetrable Bastion''''s immunity Buff is now unaffected by things that modify the expiry rate of Buffs, such as Temporal Chains. It now has a global cooldown of 20 seconds.
}}
{{Version history table row|3.26.0|
* Introduced to the game.
}}
{{Version history table end}}
